## Component

**`s3presign.Runner`** — a background runner in package `s3presign` that refreshes S3 presigned URLs stored on attachments so externally stored content links do not expire.

Implementation: `/bench/repo/server/runner/s3presign/runner.go`

## Schedule

**Every 12 hours**, plus **one immediate run at startup**.

```26:27:/bench/repo/server/runner/s3presign/runner.go
// Schedule runner every 12 hours.
const runnerInterval = time.Hour * 12
```

The ticker loop in `Run()` fires on that interval:

```29:40:/bench/repo/server/runner/s3presign/runner.go
func (r *Runner) Run(ctx context.Context) {
	ticker := time.NewTicker(runnerInterval)
	defer ticker.Stop()

	for {
		select {
		case <-ticker.C:
			r.RunOnce(ctx)
		case <-ctx.Done():
			return
		}
	}
}
```

Refresh logic: it lists S3 attachments in batches of 100 and re-presigns any whose URL will expire within 4 days (presigned URLs themselves last 5 days):

